Data derived from simulator assets
----------------------------------
frozen_B_adapter_v1r2/files/runs/step6_fixed_frames_cpu_v1/frame_proposal.json and ik_results.json contain frame
offsets and IK solutions computed from the RoboLab Franka (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0) and Kinova (BSD-3-Clause) robot assets.
They are numeric measurements, not geometry, meshes or textures. The full body-frame dump (joint_graphs.json) is left
out; experiments/bowl_step6/extract_arm_kinematics.py regenerates it from a RoboLab checkout. Rendered images and
videos appear only in the website folder, docs/ (next section).

