Method credit
-------------
Exterior cross-painting follows Mirage: L. Y. Chen, K. Hari, K. Dharmarajan, C. Xu, Q. Vuong and K. Goldberg,
"Mirage: Cross-Embodiment Zero-Shot Policy Transfer with Cross-Painting", RSS 2024, arXiv:2402.19249.
No Mirage code is included; this repository implements a simulator version that renders from ground truth.

Code-export supplement (25 October 2026, updated 26 October): authored Nemotron annotation, intent-demo and Charlie
DROP/perception tooling are included as source-only snapshots; the Charlie packages and the intent demo were prepared
and never run in the simulator. ABBA (experiments/roger_bravo_one_shot_v1/) is the project's own code and ran once;
evidence/abba_l4003/ holds that run's trace, score, API ledger and the text of its 29 Nemotron requests and replies.
The images sent to Nemotron are renders of the RoboLab scene and robot assets and are not included; their sha256
values appear in each request.json. No provider SDK source or model weights are included, and no rendered media outside docs/. Original
third-party dependencies retain their own licences. Offline tests are described in OFFLINE_EXPORT_CHECKS.md.
